Error [E0202]: the write-capability marker `&` needs a plain named binding after it
  --> tests/ui/write_index_argument_teaches_range_window.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     edit(&values[0])
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: write access from the write-capability marker `&` can only be granted to a named binding, not an expression
 Fix: change the helper to accept a list window, then pass a range write window with the write-capability marker `&`, such as `&xs[a..b]`
